From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] tdh: load instrumentation manifests and answer TdhGetEventInformation (3675)

tdh: load instrumentation manifests and answer TdhGetEventInformation

TdhLoadManifest parses an ETW instrumentation manifest (.man) and
TdhGetEventInformation fills a TRACE_EVENT_INFO for an event record from it:
descriptor (level, task, opcode, channel, keywords), provider/level/channel/
task/opcode/keyword/event/provider-message strings (resolved from the
manifest's string table), and the template's properties with in/out types,
maps, lengths, counts and structs. TdhUnloadManifest removes a loaded
manifest. TdhLoadManifestFromBinary makes the documented file/resource checks.
---
